8844", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036696_194179613772177_1573978079084844927_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8yCgp3sOvrQQ7kNvwEdb0Sp&_nc_oc=Adky_xzhNfd95FjWNrbFVfmLZqbkstiJKGvj1IToFRwx1Nnj4R02zNuwAVS8Aw5JBco&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsYrp1eF_mJ2MhqAJn_dGlh2Ce6rzPYx6UGgOGavoLZLA&oe=69A0599E"}, {"file_name": "movesapiensdrone.png", "id": "764669845469577", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984445_764669848802910_7366831044223632089_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x0QQASEl-aIQ7kNvwH1jgJi&_nc_oc=AdkOxhcXgtAtpje5WB8BqqY_m6tSkAB3VVQeQ2stUT4EOd3MLZT99EPcWyJmUaHN-aw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu9gR3B9y-8Pjef2mCgj8YYlbqXPY5ngfbhXY9-XlNlMg&oe=69A0350B"}, {"file_name": "movesapiensready.png", "id": "337520715646442", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982478_337520718979775_5518724192048290935_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y23g789cQKYQ7kNvwHTR9HW&_nc_oc=AdmKXq9BWLL-RgsOzzzfMgpyhjIpSLNPbHw4GEnxzPqB-_Dhd272-BU-qlQo7IMev7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuMeUcsOhy04xA-BvLNAkeCyU65g2DvbHmGtWOJAsLlyA&oe=69A04F35"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "movesapiensbattle.png", "id": "369502332406406", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974567_369502335739739_4753847007498255395_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7Q-soreDaX0Q7kNvwGPL95z&_nc_oc=AdmTvcXn4WXvqNKU0QsBaOzbwJFIBuCfSpy83pd9wgrygckqsijP2H5Ej47qxEJOQAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfucJaEMRTvBd9RBELqM9rtdt-jFQz2OQfhmDsi4y6NuAQ&oe=69A03992"}, "display_name": "Move Sapiens Ltda", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dive into the year 2107 with \"Move Sapiens Exoskeleton VR,\" an Oculus App Lab sensation blending HIIT (High-Intensity Interval Training) and virtual reality gaming. As a symbol of constant evolution and scientific validation within sports science, this game is more than just an experience\u2014it's a revolution.\n\nYou'll be greeted by S.A.I.H.A., your Symbiont Artificial Intelligence for Human Augmentation, integrated into the groundbreaking Move Sapiens Exoskeleton. In a dystopian world dominated by omnipotent corporations, your mission is clear: evolve, adapt, and dismantle the tyrannical forces. Train rigorously against a reprogrammed drone, enhancing your physical and cognitive abilities symbiotically.\n\nOur game boasts a unique Kinetic Energy Optimization System, allowing you to absorb and manipulate energy, granting unprecedented powers. The training comprises 12 blocks of intense 16-second HIIT boxing sessions, with 20 seconds for kinetic energy reloading. Every punch counts, monitored for speed and strength.\n\nAs you master kinetic manipulation, S.A.I.H.A. offers real-time data processing and strategic insights, optimizing every move towards liberation. The game is an immersive journey, a synergy of biology and technology, pushing you beyond human constraints. Be part of the vanguard, embody the nexus of human spirit and artificial intelligence, and forge a new era of freedom and justice.\n\nJoin us in \"Move Sapiens Exoskeleton VR\" \u2013 where gaming meets evolution, and every move", "short_description": "\"Move Sapiens Exoskeleton VR\" is an Oculus App Lab game set in 2107, where players train in a dystopian world using the Move Sapiens Exoskeleton and AI S.A.I.H.A. The game combines HIIT with VR, focusing on physical and cognitive enhancement through rigorous training. It features a unique Kinetic Energy Optimization System for absorbing and manipulating energy, with gameplay involving intense HIIT boxing sessions. The game aims to push players beyond human limits, blending technology and biology"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://movesapiens.my.canva.site/politica-de-privacidade", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null